					"speakerTitle": "Dori"
				},
				{
					"id": 765060702,
					"content": "Might you two be having some trouble, by any chance? I might be on vacation, but far be it from me to reject any business that comes knocking at my door.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						765060703,
						765060704
